    "text": "By Manny Sandoval ,\n10 hours ago Fiesta Village Family Fun Park, a longtime family destination for Colton and the Inland Empire, will close its doors for good July 11 after more than 50 years in business, while neighboring Nickelodeon Pizza is making clear that it remains open. Current Fiesta Village owners Michelle and Patrick O’Brien announced... Read full article\n3",
